  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="65c1453f-c8cb-524e-987e-6c4a6e8333b0" activityNameId="f7343be8-546f-5f1f-9fbb-14306358bcfb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">CEM II, A cement, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: CEM II, A cement, at plant
The dataset describes the production of cement (CEM II-A) in Switzerland and covers the representative production mix of CEM II/A-D, CEM II/A-LL and CEM II/A-S according to EN 197-1. \nTechnology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Mineralische Baustoffe\nLocal subcategory: Bindemittel\nUVEK 2022 ;UUID: 0da651cb-94ae-3dea-88fb-3807b29363f6
The activity starts with the clinker in the silo to be used for cement production and with the additional ingredients of the cement at the gate of the cement plant.  The activity includes also the electricy used for the grinding of the clinker, griding aids, heat for the drying of additions etc. and ends with the cement produced in the cement mill. The dataset does not include packaging and administration.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0da651cb-94ae-3dea-88fb-3807b29363f6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
